SUMMARY:Olio Comedy Club: A Night of Stand-Up
DESCRIPTION:What do a New Yorker Cartoonist\, a Sperm Scientist\, a Chemica
 l Engineer\, and an Economist all have in common?&nbsp\;In this particular
  case\, they are all professional comedians\, and are excited to bring you
  a night of PowerPoint comedy at the Olio Lighthouse.&nbsp\;Hosted by Luke
  Strathmann\, who some of you know from his Beanie Babies presentation at 
 Obsession Night\, four of NYC’s best comedians who promise they are real
 ly good at computers will each make funny PowerPoint presentations about w
 hatever they want.&nbsp\;Who’s going to be there?Asher Perlman is an Emm
 y-winning\, WGA Award-winning\, Peabody Award-winning comedian\, writer\, 
 cartoonist\, and best-selling author. Until recently\, he was a writer/per
 former on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, and is currently a cartooni
 st at The New Yorker\, a performer with the Improvised Shakespeare Company
 \, and a touring comic.Website: https://ashermaxperlman.comIG: https://www
 .instagram.com/asherperlman/?hl=enShafi Hossain is a nationally touring co
 median\, and currently the funniest chemical engineer in the world. He has
  made his TV appearance on Kevin Hart's LOL Network's show Road Comics -cu
 rrently streaming on Peacock. Shafi was named one of New York's Funniest S
 tand Up by the New York Comedy Festival. He has over 140K social media fol
 lowing and is a regular at the world renowned Comedy Cellar.Website: https
 ://shafihossaincomedy.carrd.coIG: https://www.instagram.com/shafistandsup/
 ?hl=enSarah Adelman is a born and bred New Yorker\, stand up comic\, and s
 creenwriter (and former scientist). As a stand-up\, she’s a regular at N
 ew York Comedy Club\, Union Hall\, DontTellComedy — and tours nationally
 .&nbsp\; She is the creator\, host\, and EP of “BLOW MY MIND\,” an ori
 ginal social series with 50M+ views. In each episode\, she sits down with 
 a guest as they present her with a mind-blowing science fact. The show was
  featured in the New York Times. She also regularly teaches science commun
 ication courses at universities!&nbsp\;Website: https://www.sarahadelmanco
 medy.comIG: https://www.instagram.com/sarahadelman1/Luke Strathmann runs t
 he communications team at Yale’s Department of Economics\, where he’s 
 Editor-in-Chief of the Yale Economics Magazine. He’s previously worked f
 or MIT and Princeton’s economics departments\, the World Bank\, more UN 
 agencies than he can remember\, Omidyar Network\, and the AI Now Institute
 . His humor writing has appeared in The New Yorker and McSweeney’s\, and
  he performs comedy at clubs all around NYC. He is the host of EconLOL\, t
 he world's first\, best\, and only live economics-themed comedy show.Websi
 te: https://www.lukestrathmann.comIG: https://www.instagram.com/lstrathm/?
 hl=enThe evening flow:&nbsp\;7:30pm - Doors open\, grab a drink get settle
 d and hangout8:00pm -&nbsp\; Show Begins and we laugh a lot9:15pm - Show e
 nds but we hangout at the space and laugh some more10:00pm - Goodnight new
  friends!What Is an Olio?Think Olio is an ongoing experiment in lifelong l
 earning. We are a community of open-minded people who gather to exchange i
 deas with new friends and connect over art\, literature\, and philosophy.C
 heck out our full calendarOur $30 membership gives you two events for the 
 price of one!&nbsp\;An Olio is what we call the social learning events we
 ’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend between a lecture and a house pa
 rty\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their passions and the 
 room is filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Our goal is t
 o spark new perspectives\, ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially
  offering an alternative to typical nightlife options.Disclaimer: By purch
 asing a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for social media/
 marketing materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\, feel fre
 e to send us a note.Photo by Zhi-Da Zhong\n\nTickets & info: https://www.v
 iewcy.com/event/powerpoint_comedy_clu
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/powerpoint_comedy_clu
END:VEVENT
