SUMMARY:One Year Anniversary: Olio Homecoming Dance 2026
DESCRIPTION:Homecoming ‘26Our little venue is officially one year old!! W
 e gotta celebrate! Let's have a homecoming dance? Why? Why not?!&nbsp\;Man
 y of us grew up in cities where we never had a homecoming dance and those 
 of us who did need an opportunity to wear that tux and gown again!&nbsp\;P
 ut on something nice\, pin on a corsage and bring a date. Your +1 can be y
 our partner\, your best friend\, your coworker or that person from last we
 ek’s Olio you’ve been meaning to text. Members can bring more than one
  this time\, and feel free to bring the friend who goes to a different sch
 ool. Of course\, you are welcome to come solo (most people will). We're go
 ing all out for our Members&nbsp\; and their dates (aka +1's)&nbsp\;To att
 end you can either be a member of the Olio Lighthouse or invited by one. Y
 ou should just become a member though...it's the best community and you ca
 n just cancel if you somehow don't enjoy welcoming\, kind and intellectual
 ly curious community :)&nbsp\;What's it gonna look like??&nbsp\;Pick your 
 superlative. At check-in you’ll choose a card from our list of deeply sp
 ecific “Most Likely To…” titles. A few other people will have picked
  the same one so try to find them throughout the night.A punch bowl. Red\,
  obviously. There’ll be a spiked one and a virgin one\, plus champagne b
 ecause it’s our birthday.DJ Usefulstyles playing early-2000s homecoming 
 bangers\, with a slow dance portion for you and your new crush.&nbsp\;The 
 Coronation. The Homecoming Committee has counted the votes. Stay for the c
 rowning\, a toast and a short highlight reel from year one\, with a little
  peek at year two.Corsage bar. Make your own from a big pile of fresh flow
 ers.The photo wall. We’ll have a photographer for you and your date\, so
  dress for it.Cake. It’s our birthday.Smoke machine\, lasers\, streamers
 \, balloons and a disco ball. A cheeky cig on the roof on a crisp fall nig
 ht. Rumor has it something happens in the loft.&nbsp\;Dress code: Funky Fo
 rmal&nbsp\;Interpret freely: sequins\, velvet\, a thrifted prom dress\, yo
 ur dad’s blazer with something a little unhinged underneath. The one rul
 e is no sneakers and no streetwear. The chaperones will be checking at the
  door.Schedule&nbsp\;8:00pm: Doors. You’ll be greeted by some Olio chape
 rones who will help you pick out the hyper-specific superlative that match
 es your current vibe. Hit the punch bowl and meet your new friends.&nbsp\;
 &nbsp\;~9:30pm: Coronation + year-one highlight reel&nbsp\;10:00pm–1:00a
 m: Dance party&nbsp\;Tickets&nbsp\;Capacity is capped at 60\, so grab your
 s early.Chaperoned by the Olio Homecoming Committee.Tickets:To attend sign
  up for our monthly membership which gives you two credits to use towards 
 our events each month.&nbsp\;You must be 21 or older to attend.What is Thi
 nk Olio?Think Olio is an ongoing experiment in lifelong learning. We are a
  community of open-minded people who gather to exchange ideas with new fri
 ends and connect over art\, literature\, and philosophy.An Olio is what we
  call the social learning events we’ve been organizing since 2015. A ble
 nd between a lecture and a house party\, Olios are led by a teacher who lo
 ves sharing their passions and the room is filled with curious\, open-mind
 ed New Yorkers.&nbsp\;A year into creating a venue\, one of our favorite f
 eelings has been the moments where we’ve stepped outside of time. We’v
 e created a space where conversations don’t feel rushed\, people are gre
 eted with hugs\, and as a community\, we spontaneously come up with new id
 eas (like the dial-up-disco house party) and bring them to life.Our goal i
 s to spark new perspectives\, ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socia
 lly\, an alternative to typical nightlife options.Check out our full calen
 darDisclaimer: By purchasing a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video
  used for social media/marketing materials. If you prefer to not have your
  photo taken\, feel free to send us a note.\n\nTickets & info: https://www
 .viewcy.com/event/homecoming-olio
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/homecoming-olio
END:VEVENT
